# Template and planning migration changes

Source: open-gsd/gsd-core c0b2a05d2f310adc0a1f35fd71fbc9f28f4e4977 (MIT).

This log records adaptations and conflict resolutions, not a shortened replacement
for upstream templates. Imported guidance must retain its full instructional text.

## 2026-09-13 — Scope and precedence

- The current request authorizes complete upstream templates, a separate .planning
  data directory, supporting reference reconciliation, and draft progress pushes.
- Earlier exclusions of milestone templates and phase-local PLAN naming are
  superseded where they conflict with this request. Optional templates do not
  create an adopting project or require using every artifact for every change.
- The phase runtime retains its no-automatic-merge boundary. The coordinator may
  merge this migration after review and checks under the user's explicit request.
- Primary has an existing uncommitted .ai/templates/CONTEXT.md edit. Preserve it
  throughout migration and final synchronization; all work uses assigned worktrees.
